  "StockRole": "Juggernaut",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Attor is Clan Cloud Cobra's totem assault OmniMech, developed to replace the aging Highlander IIC. Named after an old Terran word for \"poison,\" it emphasizes raw power and battlefield resilience. With 15 tons of Ferro-Fibrous armor, integral CASE II, and a built-in Supercharger, the Attor is both durable and mobile. Each variant includes advanced electronics such as Angel ECM, Active Probes, or Targeting Computers. Despite having 41 tons of pod space, the design avoids lighter weapons entirely. The Attor follows a \"go big or go home\" philosophy, making it a distinctive and dangerous presence in any combat scenario.",
